starting permutation: s2x s1a s2l s1c
step s2x: EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT cti.dag_id, cti.task_id, cti.run_id, cti.priority_weight FROM cti JOIN crun ON crun.dag_id = cti.dag_id AND crun.run_id = cti.run_id JOIN cdag ON cti.dag_id = cdag.dag_id WHERE crun.state = 'running' AND crun.run_type <> 'backfill' AND cti.state = 'scheduled' AND cdag.is_paused = false ORDER BY -cti.priority_weight, crun.execution_date, cti.map_index, cti.task_id LIMIT 4 FOR UPDATE OF cti;
QUERY PLAN                                                                                                  
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Limit                                                                                                       
  ->  LockRows                                                                                              
        ->  Sort                                                                                            
              Sort Key: ((- cti.priority_weight)), crun.execution_date, cti.map_index, cti.task_id          
              ->  Nested Loop                                                                               
                    Join Filter: (crun.dag_id = cdag.dag_id)                                                
                    ->  Hash Join                                                                           
                          Hash Cond: ((cti.dag_id = crun.dag_id) AND (cti.run_id = crun.run_id))            
                          ->  Seq Scan on cti                                                               
                                Filter: (state = 'scheduled'::text)                                         
                          ->  Hash                                                                          
                                ->  Seq Scan on crun                                                        
                                      Filter: ((run_type <> 'backfill'::text) AND (state = 'running'::text))
                    ->  Index Scan using cdag_pkey on cdag                                                  
                          Index Cond: (dag_id = cti.dag_id)                                                 
                          Filter: (NOT is_paused)                                                           
(16 rows)

